        "tags": ["OIDC - Admin"],
        "summary": "Returns a page of OIDC applications.",
        "description": "Returns a page of registered OIDC client applications with their full configuration: client ID, display name, type, tenant, permissions, redirect URIs, consent type, and signing-key presence. Paginated via the 'page' (1-based, default 1) and 'pageSize' (default 25, max 100) query parameters; the envelope carries the total count and a has-more flag.",
