      "post": {
        "tags": ["OIDC - Admin"],
        "summary": "Creates a new OIDC application.",
        "description": "Registers a new OIDC client with the specified permissions, redirect URIs, and consent policy. Set generateClientSecret=true to have the server mint a cryptographically strong secret and return it once in the response's generatedClientSecret field (confidential client); alternatively provide clientSecret explicitly; omitting both creates a public client. Stored secrets are hashed. Returns 409 Conflict if a client with the same client ID already exists.",
