        "summary": "Returns a page of OIDC authorizations.",
        "description": "Returns a page of OIDC authorizations. Each authorization represents a user's consent grant to an application, with its status (valid, revoked) and type (permanent, ad-hoc). Paginated via the 'page' (1-based, default 1) and 'pageSize' (default 25, max 100) query parameters; the envelope carries the total count and a has-more flag. Optionally filter server-side by 'subject' (user id) and/or 'clientId'; an unknown clientId yields an empty page.",
        "operationId": "ListOidcAuthorizations",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "page",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "1-based page index.",
            "schema": {
